## Phase 2: 6–12 months — build and validate

Dependencies:

- Local infrastructure and operational partners;
- identity, key, logging, backup, and recovery controls;
- contractual annexes;
- migration tooling;
- customer assurance portal;
- support model;
- security testing;
- disaster-recovery testing; and
